+"""Tests for Exp 3825 offline verifier-oracle Q-head distillation.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-3825, SCENARIO-3825-SKIP, SCENARIO-3825-TRAIN,
+SCENARIO-3825-ABLATION.
+"""
